---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Prints how a running app's tree, errors, and commits look, from the devtools hub. `open` prints the hub address for the inspector page

Usage: leptoskit debug [COMMAND]

Commands:
  tree         Prints the element tree: kind, text, classes, frame, and source line
  errors       Prints failed plugin calls and server attempts
  performance  Prints render commits and, when the app was profiling, layout and draw time
  open         Prints the hub address. Open it to use the inspector
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
